# Android DPC Standards

- Kotlin; DevicePolicyManager; DeviceAdminReceiver; WorkManager; FCM.
- Do not claim Device Owner success from normal APK install. QR / Android Enterprise paths: docs/device-management/ANDROID-ENROLLMENT.md. Implementation is custom DPC (D-057), not AMAPI lock.
- Enrollment QR must not contain Wi-Fi passwords, private keys, or integration secrets. Do not require disabling Play Protect.
- Lock Task Mode is the LOCK UX; do not use lockNow() as mp_pay lock. Ask before factory-resetting devices.
- Support graduated levels 1–5 per product docs; preserve emergency calling.
- Commands are async; ack results to backend; handle offline retry.
- No hidden DPC, no emergency block, no destructive collection actions.
- Document OEM compatibility from real device tests. Not all SKUs support the same provisioning gesture.
